---
import { attraction } from '../config/site';
import { visitorServices } from '../data/visitor-services';
---

<section id="services" class="anchor-offset py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-700">Visitor services</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">
      訪客服務與周邊設施（洗手間、停車、餐飲、住宿、
      {attraction.city}市區機能）
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
      本站為非營利景點科普網站，以下僅以「設施類型」與「分布位置」做中立概述，不推薦任何特定店家或品牌。旅客可依自己的預算與偏好在{attraction.city}
      {attraction.locality}周邊自行選擇。
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
      {
        visitorServices.map(group => (
          <section class="card-surface overflow-hidden">
            <header class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-stone-200 px-5 py-4">
              <span
                class={`inline-flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-xl ${group.tone}`}
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                {group.icon}
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">{group.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-xs tracking-wide text-stone-500">{group.subtitle}</p>
              </div>
            </header>
            <dl class="divide-y divide-stone-100">
              {group.items.map(item => (
                <div class="px-5 py-3">
                  <dt class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900">{item.label}</dt>
                  <dd class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600">{item.desc}</dd>
                </div>
              ))}
            </dl>
          </section>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
      設施位置與營業時間可能隨管理單位調整而變動，出發前建議再確認一次；政府部門與營業商家的最新資訊請以官方公告為準。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
